1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:26,375
甘き声
My sweet banshee cry
Mon doux cri de banshee

2
00:00:26,375 --> 00:00:50,500
鼓動を乱し
Makes your heartbeat miss a beat
Fait trébucher ton cœur

3
00:00:50,500 --> 00:01:14,625
記録奪う
Then I steal your save
Puis je vole ta partie

4
00:01:14,625 --> 00:01:45,000
紅い唇
Red lips, wicked smile
Lèvres rouges, doux vice

5
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:09,125
皆恋に落ち
Every player falls in love
Tous les joueurs tombent amoureux

6
00:02:09,125 --> 00:02:35,250
幕が閉じる
Before game over
Avant la fin du jeu

